ancial Results. In the Audited Standalone and Consolidated statement of Cash Flows for the quarter ended March 31, 2026, an item pertaining to investing activities, i.e., investment in fixed deposits was inadvertently classified under the head of ‘Operating Activities’ under Increase in other financial assets and loans instead of ‘Investing Activities’. Consequently, the Net cash flow from operating activities was incorrectly reported as negative, whereas the same arose solely on account of the above classification error.\r\nAccordingly, the Company is submitting the revised / rectified Statement of financial results with rectified Cash Flows reflecting the correct classification of the said item under cash flow from investing activities.", "seq_Id": "164767", "smName": "Knowledge Marine & Engineering Works Limited", "symbol": "KMEW", "type": "Integrated Filing- Financials", "type_Sub": "Revision", "xbrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/xbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_1677534_30052026050331_WEB.xml", "xbrlFileSize": "141.43 KB"}, {"attFileSize": "0 Bytes", "audited": "Audited", "broadcast_Date": null, "cmName": "Knowledge Marine & Engineering Works Limited", "consolidated": "Consolidated", "creation_Date": "30-May-2026 17:03:17", "diff": "00:00:02", "ixbrl": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ixbrl/INTEGRATED_FILING_INDAS_164765_30052026170316_iXBRL_WEB.html", "ixbrlFileSize": "80.66 KB", "pdf_attach": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/null", "qe_Date": "31-MAR-2026", "revised_Date": "30-MAY-2026 17:03:15", "revision_Remark": "there is a classification error in the Statement of Cash Flows forming part of the submitted Financial Results. In the Audited Standalone and Consolidated statement of Cash Flows for the quarter ended March 31, 2026, an item pertaining to investing activities, i.e., investment in fixed deposits was inadvertently classified under the head of ‘Operating Activities’ under Increase in other financial assets and loans i